<title>USA: Cascade Bancorp establishes dividend.</title>
<headline>Cascade Bancorp establishes dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BEND, Ore. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Bancorp said it established a quarterly cash dividend and the payment of a cash dividend of $.10 per share to all shareholders of record on August 4, 1997, reported President Roger J. Shields.</p>
<p>The distribution date will be August 11, 1997.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is a result of the Bank's continued strong earnings and the board's desire to return a portion of those earnings to shareholders.</p>
</text>
